title: Delivery pipeline {near: top-center; shape: text; style.font-size: 24}
direction: right

push: Push {shape: oval}
lint: Lint
unit: Unit tests
build: Build image
scan: Image scan
gate: All green? {shape: diamond}
staging: Deploy to staging
fix: Fix and push again
e2e: End-to-end tests
approve: Approved? {shape: diamond}
prod: Deploy to production
smoke: Smoke tests
rollback: Roll back

push -> lint
push -> unit
push -> build
build -> scan
lint -> gate
unit -> gate
scan -> gate
gate -> staging: yes
gate -> fix: no
fix -> push
staging -> e2e
e2e -> approve
approve -> prod: yes
approve -> fix: no
prod -> smoke
smoke -> rollback: fails
